<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Western Deep Q3 available profit falls.</title>
<headline>Western Deep Q3 available profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-September versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Available profit		 32.5   vs 46.4</p>
<p>    Capital spending		 39.5   vs 33.4</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled		 1,251,000 vs 1,160,000</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)		  7,830 vs 8,293</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)		     6.26 vs 7.15</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)		   46,345 vs 42,003</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		54,926 vs 53,011</p>
<p>Full name: Western Deep Levels Ltd, managed by Anglo American Corp of South Africa Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
